{
  "abstract": "Evidence is presented for a new meson resonance at 2340\u00b120 MeV, with a width of 180\u00b160 MeV, decaying primarily into \u03c1\u03c1\u03c0. The resonance, which is observed in 15-GeV/c \u03c0+p interactions, has isotopic spin 1 or 2 and odd G parity. The cross section for production of the \u03c1\u03c1\u03c0 state is 7.3\u00b11.7 \u03bcb. Branching ratios into \u03c1\u03c1\u03c0 and other decay modes are given.",
